28097      ods graphics on;
28098      * Request a Spline Transformation of Equivalence Ratio;
28099      proc transreg data=Gas solve ss2 plots=(transformation obp residuals);
28100      model identity(nox) = spline(EqRatio / nknots=4);
28101      run;

NOTE: 2 observations were deleted from the analysis due to missing values.
NOTE: Algorithm converged.
NOTE: There were 112 observations read from the data set WORK.GAS.
