28102      * Separate Curves and Intercepts;
28103      proc transreg data=Gas solve ss2 additive plots=(transformation obp);
28104      model identity(nox) = class(Fuel / zero=none) |
28105      spline(EqRatio / nknots=4 after);
28106      run;

NOTE: Since the model contains SMOOTH, BSPLINE, PBSPLINE, or a CLASS expansion with ZERO=NONE, a model with an implicit intercept is fit.
